-   Manage users if they are company_admin
-   View QR and USSD verification logs

Company users cannot:

-   See other companies
-   Approve their own label orders
-   Access global admin pages
-   Change fraud rules unless allowed

Please design routes, middleware, policies, layout structure, navigation, and role permissions.

