-   A public endpoint for USSD provider callbacks
-   A simulated USSD test page for local testing
-   Code lookup by unique label code
-   Short response messages for feature phones
-   Verification logs for every attempt
-   Suspicious flagging when a code is checked too many times
-   Support for invalid, revoked, expired, recalled, and already-used codes

Example customer flow:
